WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.332 --> 00:00:04.528
- A professional butler
is somebody who is loyal,

00:00:04.528 --> 00:00:07.945
flexible, discreet, hard-working, honest,

00:00:08.859 --> 00:00:10.796
but most important, it is a person

00:00:10.796 --> 00:00:14.028
who has the ability to
put somebody else's wishes

00:00:14.028 --> 00:00:15.904
before your own.

00:00:15.904 --> 00:00:17.687
That is what makes this a profession

00:00:17.687 --> 00:00:19.687
so very, very difficult.

00:00:25.209 --> 00:00:28.209
At the age of 21, I became a butler.

00:00:29.439 --> 00:00:34.363
Nowadays, I am chairman of the
International Butler Academy.

00:00:34.363 --> 00:00:36.705
The International Butler
Academy is located

00:00:36.705 --> 00:00:39.512
in the beautiful village of Simpelveld

00:00:39.512 --> 00:00:41.247
in the Netherlands.

00:00:41.247 --> 00:00:43.553
You have about 135 rooms,

00:00:43.553 --> 00:00:46.684
80,000 square feet completely dedicated

00:00:46.684 --> 00:00:49.734
to the training of butlers.

00:00:49.734 --> 00:00:51.950
Our students live here in our building.

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:56.589
They come, literally, from
every country in the world.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.089
Age from 18 to 68.

00:00:59.582 --> 00:01:01.344
- Okay, five minutes, guys.

00:01:01.344 --> 00:01:03.413
- Students learn about housekeeping,

00:01:03.413 --> 00:01:06.819
house management, estate
management, regular things,

00:01:06.819 --> 00:01:09.660
like even suitcase
packing, silver shining,

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:13.212
shining shoes, the list is enormous.

00:01:13.212 --> 00:01:15.508
There's an incredible amount of training

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:17.907
to be done in 10 weeks.

00:01:17.907 --> 00:01:20.761
Discipline here at the
International Butler Academy

00:01:20.761 --> 00:01:23.361
is very, very important.

00:01:23.361 --> 00:01:27.459
In order to get a job
done, you need discipline.

00:01:27.459 --> 00:01:30.481
I think in order to be
successful, you need discipline

00:01:30.481 --> 00:01:32.135
and discipline here at school is something

00:01:32.135 --> 00:01:36.302
we embrace and not something
that we are afraid of.

00:01:38.272 --> 00:01:41.675
Here at school we always joke
about what employers want.

00:01:41.675 --> 00:01:43.551
They need a clean toilet.

00:01:43.551 --> 00:01:46.362
They want a warm bed
and they want a hot meal

00:01:46.362 --> 00:01:49.541
and those three things are
most important for everyone.

00:01:49.541 --> 00:01:52.174
- [Butler] You go right, you go left.

00:01:52.174 --> 00:01:55.293
- [Robert] My wife and I,
we have our own butler.

00:01:55.293 --> 00:01:57.795
I'm very fortunate; I've
had a private butler

00:01:57.795 --> 00:02:00.844
now for the past 17 years and this person

00:02:00.844 --> 00:02:03.344
is very, very important to me.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:08.268
Being a butler can certainly
be a wonderful career

00:02:08.268 --> 00:02:10.448
simply because if you are responsible

00:02:10.448 --> 00:02:12.090
for the well-being of the family,

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.066
for their happiness, that is obviously

00:02:14.066 --> 00:02:16.598
very, very, very important.

00:02:16.598 --> 00:02:19.765
(uptempo regal music)

